WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.150
Tell me again how this is safer
than the watchtower.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.850
I said it was quieter, not safer.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.050
Something is moving in there.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.800
That was supposed to help?

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:11.850
Stay close.
